  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Institute for Social Accountability (TISA) is a Kenyan civil society organization committed to promoting transparency, participation, and accountability through research, policy, and advocacy. TISA facilitates citizen oversight of the decentralization of Kenya&#x2019;s governance and resource allocation through monitoring and campaigns, such as the Okoa Uchumi campaigns for more public scrutiny of Kenya&#x2019;s growing sovereign debt. This grant will support TISA&apos;s leadership and staff development.</narrative>
  </description>
